/// M07 CORE-035 "bundled mixed questions: 8 assert roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/questions_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledMixedQuestions.
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/native/questions.can (read
/// at Go L111, staged pristine as src/main.can at L115-116 with only the
/// endpoint rewritten to the test server; the duplicate mutation at L154,
/// handler/record faults at L167-183, confidence restage at L197-202 and
/// two-stage splice at L228-255 apply to later legs only, never the
/// assert leg).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 8 roots grounded per function in questions.can: report 1,
/// assess 1, roundtrip 1, main 1, helpers 4 (identity, keep,
/// keep_after_index, unwrap), asks-only 0. The report carries the
/// supplied-completion label (Go L139).
/// Live question semantics (batch request, answer kinds, invalid/
/// duplicate/handler/record gates, confidence fallback, two-stage
/// followup, raw provider, strict emission) live in
/// core-035-questions-semantics.can; the production process shape lives
/// in core-035-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); invalid (Go L147-151),
/// duplicate (L154-161), handler/record faults (L167-192), confidence
/// fallback (L197-205), two-stage followup (L212-265) and raw provider
/// (L267-340) belong to the questions-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. CAN_I27_TOKEN is harness-supplied
/// (Go L123: "test-only"), not an external gate. Logical gates
/// SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23/QHTTP; no live
/// run now. Descriptor timeout 120000ms mirrors the Go 2-minute ctx (L62).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case bundled/questions-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, report-roots, assess-roots, roundtrip-roots,
/// main-roots, helper-roots, asks-roots, label-supplied.
/// Facet map (questions_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L139-141: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test fatals);
/// report-passed pins the passed report (derived from the L139 exit-0
/// pin: canlc assert exits nonzero on failure); root-count pins the eight
/// roots (fixture asserts blocks: report L18-19, assess L131-133,
/// roundtrip L150-151, main L162-163, identity L182-183, keep L191-192,
/// keep_after_index L200-201, unwrap L210-211); fixture-name grounds the
/// pins in the staged fixture (L111: questions.can; L116: src/main.can);
/// report-roots pins report (fixture L18-19 direct, 1 root); assess-roots
/// pins assess (fixture L131-133 sample, 1 root); roundtrip-roots pins
/// roundtrip (fixture L150-151 generated, 1 root); main-roots pins main
/// (fixture L162-163 sample, 1 root); helper-roots pins the four helpers
/// (identity L182-183, keep L191-192, keep_after_index L200-201, unwrap
/// L210-211, 4 roots); asks-roots pins the ten asks-only declarations
/// (likelihood L40-44, choose L46-52, dynamic L54-64, rate L66-75,
/// weights L77-82, levels L84-90, left_arm L92-95, right_arm L97-100,
/// spread L110-115, spread_weights L117-125: asks/choice arms only, no
/// asserts block, 0 roots); label-supplied pins the report label (L139:
/// stdout contains "supplied-completion").
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
